  <description akvo:type="4" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TA facility to conduct a market assessment for a WASH loan product in Cambodia</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The TA will be used by LOLC Cambodia to explore the SME WASH market and prepare for part 2 of the transaction.

&#xB7; The key topics to be addressed with the TA are:

o Market Potential and Ecosystem mapping;

o Product development and capacity building;

o Market development and product roll out support;

&#x200B;</narrative>
  </description>
